{"step_index":1222,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-10T21:42:39Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-11T05:42:39+08:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-11T05:42:40+08:00\nCreated At: 2026-11-11T05:42:39+08:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-11T05:42:40+08:00\nShowing lines 125-136 of 136\n125: ### Non-Major (Patch 1.0.22)\n126: - Added silent exam-content obscuration (`.obscure` instant 0ms blur/opacity fade on `#exam`) in `index.html`, triggered on `window` `blur`, `document` `visibilitychange` when hidden, and desktop screenshot shortcut keys (`PrintScreen` and `Cmd/Ctrl+Shift+3/4/5` via `isCaptureKey(e)` + `pulseExamMask()`) without logging violations, incrementing `switches`, displaying alerts, or adding any explanatory text to the UI.\n127: - Added a faint tiled diagonal SVG student-identity watermark overlay (`#wm.wm-layer`, filled with `#7f8799` `escXml(name + ' • ' + section)`) rendered over the exam upon starting via `setWatermark()` and cleared/hidden on `finish()` and `showLock()`.\n128: - Re-applied dual-layer AST obfuscation + stream-cipher hardening to `index.html` (`teacher.html` unchanged) and re-synced `quizzes/template`.\n129: - Why: User requested silent screenshot/capture deterrence without adding violations, alerts, or mentioning its existence anywhere in the UI.\n130: \n131: ### Non-Major (Patch 1.0.23)\n132: - Fixed unconditional remote submission in `index.html`: extracted shared `isAutoRecord()` helper (`!quizData || !quizData.settings || quizData.settings.autoRecordQuiz !== false`) and gated `subData` creation and `EncryptedLocalDB.appendRecord()` in `finish()`, while reusing `isAutoRecord()` in `showLock()` (`#lkdl`).\n133: - Updated the `Submissions` tab (`#view-sub`) in `teacher.html` via `syncSubViewState()`, `stopSubPoller()`, and `syncSubPoller()` so when `settingsState.autoRecordQuiz` is `false`, `#clear-sub-btn`, `#sub-count-badge`, and `#sub-desc` are hidden via `.hide`, `#sub-feed` displays `Notice: This is only available to auto record quiz`, `clearSub` modal execution is guarded, and `listRecords(id, signal)` polling stops/aborts in-flight requests whenever Auto Record Quiz is OFF, the Submissions tab is inactive, or `document.hidden` is true.\n134: - Re-applied dual-layer AST obfuscation + stream-cipher hardening to `index.html` and `teacher.html` and re-synced `quizzes/template`.\n135: - Why: Student finishes were still uploading submissions to Firestore when Auto Record Quiz was OFF, and the user requested displaying an auto-record-only notice and hiding Clear Students on the Submissions page when Auto Record Quiz is disabled.\n136: "}
