lso resets the response lock. Are you sure this is what you want?`\n3. **`index.html` Remains Untouched:**\n   - `index.html` (`checkRemoteUnlock(data)`) already inspects `quizzes/{quizId}.lockEpoch` on load whether `autoRecordQuiz` is `true` or `false`, requiring zero changes to `index.html` or `quizzes/template`.\n\n## Research & Optimization Rationale\n- **Concurrent Execution (`Promise.all`):** Executing `Promise.all([EncryptedLocalDB.purgeRecords(quizId), EncryptedLocalDB.patchField(quizId, 'lockEpoch', nextEpoch)])` runs submission deletion and `lockEpoch` patching concurrently instead of sequentially, while reusing existing chunked-batch (`<=500`) and masked `PATCH` helpers (DRY).\n- **Zero Extra Network Reads on OFF Mode:** After `Promise.all(...)` resolves, `await refreshSubmissions()` immediately hits the `!settingsState.autoRecordQuiz` early return when OFF (`syncSubViewState()`), preserving `0` polling calls and `0` `listRecords` reads when switching back to view the Notice.\n\n## Proposed Changes\n\n### 1. Pre-hardened Source: `scratch/obf_tool/tmp_backup/teacher.html` -> Compiled `C:\\Users\\CxAdmin\\Desktop\\Exploit\\teacher.html`\n- **HTML Changes:**\n  - Remove `<button id=\"tab-btn-reset\" class=\"tab-item\" type=\"button\">Reset</button>` from `<nav class=\"tab-nav\">`.\n  - Remove `<div id=\"view-reset\" class=\"hide\">...</div>`.\n  - Add `<p id=\"sub-status-msg\" class=\"hide\" style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-weight:600\"></p>` right above `#sub-feed` inside `#view-sub` so confirmation status displays cleanly in both ON and OFF modes.\n  - Leave `<button id=\"clear-sub-btn\" ...>Clear Students</button>` always visible inside `#view-sub`.\n  - Update `#confirm-modal` text (`max-width:400px`) to:\n    `Clearing students also resets the response lock. Are you sure this is what you want?`\n- **JS Changes:**\n  - Remove `['tab-btn-reset', 'view-reset']` from `tabs` and keep `switchTab()` toggling cleanly between `tab-btn-editor` and `tab-btn-sub` (also